      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Tracking controls / source credits",
      "description": "Original MIT colored-part controls and independent annotations. The dim red part remains visible but falls below the blob threshold, producing a genuine detection gap. Coffee: Rachel Michetti, courtesy Pikolo Espresso Bar, scikit-image CC0; known integer translations and a black occlusion control. YOLOX-S: Megvii / OpenCV Zoo contributors, Apache 2.0, revision 48b10fa505aeb51fbd127fc60a5c660040e823b7; weights unchanged. Run All; green observed, amber predicted. Histograms are appearance evidence, not learned re-identification or proof of identity. See README.md, SOURCES.md and evaluate_examples.py.",
      "parameters": {},
